  "bio": "Artists\nSuppliers\nAbout\n\"I Hate Tattoos Tattoo Studio, nestled in the creative heart of London, United Kingdom, is an ironic haven for ink enthusiasts seeking mastery in geometric, dotwork, and tribal designs. The talented tattooists @fishbloke57, @kreen62tattoo, @bogdan_shandru_tattaw, and @rania.koukoumi craft each piece with precision and flair, making walk-ins and appointments alike part of a unique body art journey. For a bold statement that mirrors your individuality, dial 0203 6019881 and step into a space where art defies the norm.\"\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: London, England, United Kingdom\n\nTattooists:@fishbloke57 @kreen62tattoo  Unfortunately, after 20 years, we had to close our studio due to the lockdown fallout. DM us for tattoos 🙏",
